pothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=|\\mathfrak A|\">\\(A=|\\mathfrak A|\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\">\\(t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>；语义和代入见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"701e19aa09901897\" href=\"?note=701e19aa09901897\" title=\"57-df-term-interpretation\">57-df-term-interpretation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"237ed61a00bb9297\" href=\"?note=237ed61a00bb9297\" title=\"57-df-substitution-formula\">57-df-substitution-formula</a>。假定 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8216e0b1a4cf9570\" href=\"?note=8216e0b1a4cf9570\" title=\"57-df-free-for\">57-df-free-for</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}(t,x,\\varphi)\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[t/x][\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]/x]].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[t/x][\\beta]\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta[t^{\\mathfrak A}[\\beta]/x]].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原代入允许捕获，其语义交换律只在本条所列的自由可代入条件下使用。量词分支中由 FreeFor 保证两次赋值修改不会改变所需项值。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-term-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"701e19aa09901897","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-term-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"237ed61a00bb9297","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-free-for","status":"resolved","id":"8216e0b1a4cf9570","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-free-for]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$，$\\beta\\in\\ma